    "description": "Discover extreme value by browsing products, weekly ads, seasonal items, and more in the NEW and official Dollar Tree app! You can save all your favorites in a list curated by you, for you. Use the barcode scanner feature to see product information and price details in store. You can also stay updated on trendy new items and more. Your experience on our app includes tailored features, like selecting your store to shop at, seeing store amenities, and more.\r\n \r\nDownload the official Dollar Tree app!",
